# CodeExplorer Ontology&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt; This document is generated from source annotations during the build.&#xD;
&gt; Edit the `[OntologyNode]`, `[OntologyEdge&lt;&gt;]`, `[OntologyProperty]`, and `[OntologyRelationship]` attributes in the source files to update it.&#xD;
&#xD;
---&#xD;
&#xD;
## \ud83d\udcca Architectural Overview (Mermaid Diagram)&#xD;
&#xD;
```mermaid&#xD;
graph TD&#xD;
    subgraph Layer1 ["Layer 4: SemanticStructure (Runtime Map)"]&#xD;
        Animal["Animal"]&#xD;
        Habitat["Habitat"]&#xD;
        Zoo["Zoo"]&#xD;
    end&#xD;
&#xD;
    Animal --&gt;|LIVES_IN| Habitat&#xD;
    Zoo --&gt;|OWNS| Animal&#xD;
```&#xD;
&#xD;
---&#xD;
&#xD;
## \ud83d\udcc2 Layered Definitions&#xD;
&#xD;
### \ud83d\udcc2 Layer 4: SemanticStructure (Runtime Map)&#xD;
&#xD;
#### `Animal`&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt; Represents an animal living in a zoo.&#xD;
&#xD;
**Outbound edges:**&#xD;
&#xD;
| Relationship | To |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `LIVES_IN` | `Habitat` |&#xD;
&#xD;
**Incoming edges** *(derived from other nodes' declarations)*:&#xD;
&#xD;
| From | Relationship |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `Zoo` | `OWNS` |&#xD;
&#xD;
**Properties:**&#xD;
&#xD;
| Property | Type | Description |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `Name` | `string` | The name of the animal. |&#xD;
| `Species` | `string` | The species of the animal. |&#xD;
| `Path` | `string` | The path of the animal relative to its parent. |&#xD;
&#xD;
---&#xD;
&#xD;
#### `Habitat`&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt; Represents a physical habitat environment.&#xD;
&#xD;
**Incoming edges** *(derived from other nodes' declarations)*:&#xD;
&#xD;
| From | Relationship |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `Animal` | `LIVES_IN` |&#xD;
&#xD;
**Properties:**&#xD;
&#xD;
| Property | Type | Description |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `Name` | `string` | The name of the habitat. |&#xD;
| `Climate` | `string` | The climate type (tropical, arctic, etc.). |&#xD;
| `Path` | `string` | The path of the habitat relative to its parent. |&#xD;
&#xD;
---&#xD;
&#xD;
#### `Zoo`&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt; Represents a zoo that contains animals.&#xD;
&#xD;
**Outbound edges:**&#xD;
&#xD;
| Relationship | To |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `OWNS` | `Animal` |&#xD;
&#xD;
**Properties:**&#xD;
&#xD;
| Property | Type | Description |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `Name` | `string` | The name of the zoo. |&#xD;
| `Path` | `string` | The path of the zoo relative to its parent. |&#xD;
&#xD;
---&#xD;
&#xD;
## \ud83d\udcc2 Layer 5: SystemBindings (Integration Links)&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt; This layer contains the relationship edges that connect nodes across layers into a unified semantic map.&#xD;
&#xD;
| Relationship Label | Description |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| `LIVES_IN` | Links an Animal to the Habitat it lives in. |&#xD;
| `OWNS` | Links a Zoo to an Animal it owns. |&#xD;
&#xD;
---&#xD;
&#xD;
## \ud83c\udff7️ Uniform Resource Name (URN) &amp; ID Schemes&#xD;
&#xD;
&gt; Every node in the CodeExplorer graph has a structured ID (URN) that guarantees uniqueness across projects and workspaces.&#xD;
&#xD;
| Layer | Node Label | ID / URN Scheme |&#xD;
| :--- | :--- | :--- |&#xD;
| Layer 4: SemanticStructure (Runtime Map) | `Animal` | `{workspaceId}:animal:{name}` |&#xD;
| Layer 4: SemanticStructure (Runtime Map) | `Habitat` | `{workspaceId}:habitat:{name}` |&#xD;
| Layer 4: SemanticStructure (Runtime Map) | `Zoo` | `{workspaceId}:zoo:{name}` |&#xD;
&#xD;
"&#xD;
